{"id":"1d74032e32e804fb","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-condkolm.md","title":"Conditional Prefix-Free Complexity","display":"df-condkolm — Conditional Prefix-Free Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-condkolm","aliases":["43-df-condkolm"],"display":"df-condkolm — Conditional Prefix-Free Complexity","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-prefixfree]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.10, conditional prefix-free machines used in Theorem 6.10.2","source_printed_pages":"107–108","source_pdf_pages":"127–128","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-condkolm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-condkolm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-condkolm — Conditional Prefix-Free Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.10, conditional prefix-free machines used in Theorem 6.10.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"127–128"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。第一分量为程序，第二分量为辅助串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 表示部分函数值同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。固定满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(K_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 的值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty\">\\(\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(\\{p\\in\\Sigma^*:(p,\\tau)\\in\\operatorname{dom}M\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(\\{p\\in\\Sigma^*:(p,\\tau)\\in\\operatorname{dom}M\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(V)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(\\rho p,\\tau)\\simeq M(p,\\tau)\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(V)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(\\rho p,\\tau)\\simeq M(p,\\tau)\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_M(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\Sigma^*\\land((p,\\tau),\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}M\\},\\qquad K(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq K_V(\\sigma\\mid\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_M(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\Sigma^*\\land((p,\\tau),\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}M\\},\\qquad K(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq K_V(\\sigma\\mid\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧文件只要求二元函数通用，未要求每个辅助输入的程序域前缀自由，不能定义前缀条件复杂度。现在明确逐条件前缀自由性、统一模拟常数和空最小值。普通条件复杂度另见 df-condplainkolm。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.10, conditional prefix-free machines used in Theorem 6.10.2；印刷页 107–108，PDF 页 127–128。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixfree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*$。第一分量为程序，第二分量为辅助串。$\\mathrm{Computable}$、$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-prefixfree]]；$\\simeq$ 表示部分函数值同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。固定满足下式 $\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)$ 的 $V$；$K_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$ 的值域为 $\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$，$\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*$。第一分量为程序，第二分量为辅助串。$\\mathrm{Computable}$、$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-prefixfree]]；$\\simeq$ 表示部分函数值同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。固定满足下式 $\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)$ 的 $V$；$K_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$ 的值域为 $\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$，$\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"K_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(\\{p\\in\\Sigma^*:(p,\\tau)\\in\\operatorname{dom}M\\}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPF}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(V)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{ConditionalPF}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(\\rho p,\\tau)\\simeq M(p,\\tau)\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"K_M(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\Sigma^*\\land((p,\\tau),\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}M\\},\\qquad K(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq K_V(\\sigma\\mid\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":2337,"backlinks":[{"id":"32e75726563f73a8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C,K,C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$ 采用 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-condkolm]]。$V:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$ 为前缀自由机器，$K_V$ 采用 prefixkolm 的机器相对版本。$Q$ 量化于 $\\{C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\}$。$\\#_2$ 与自然数配对 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]；上图以下均编码成自然数集合。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-condkolm]] — Conditional Prefix-Free Complexity"},{"id":"53d7472c84d6dfc1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。"},{"id":"a87cf718c3ba311b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 配对 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 见 [[43-df-pair-coding]]。"},{"id":"5e2eccc80fe6fd4a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-kolm]] 的 $C$ 和 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $K(\\sigma\\mid\\operatorname{bin}(n))$ 采用 [[43-df-condkolm]]。"},{"id":"ea3f18feeaa80989","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}$、$K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$、$C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$ 分别采用 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]、[[43-df-condkolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]。"},{"id":"08c88154570b3baf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8fd59fd127843f3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 $\\sigma^*,\\tau^*$ 是 [[43-df-shortest-description]] 的规范最短描述。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","e7071caa967351d5","f357216a7edb035a"]}